Looking at the repository state, I see a well-developed public site with stats, countdown, recent tweaks, copy buttons for various data points, and a "Site Freshness" indicator. The site is coherent and accessible.

One small gap: the "Site Freshness" indicator (showing Current/Stale/Needs update/Unavailable) doesn't have a copy button like all the other stats do. Adding one would maintain consistency and let visitors copy the freshness status with its timestamp.

I'll add a "Copy site freshness" button following the existing pattern in `app.js`, and update `MEMORY.md`.

